OL,3,GNEWSAHealth and Safety Executive
OL,4,Ainformed over sudden death
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services have attended the
OL,7,Fscene of a sudden death in County
OL,8,FLondonderry and the Health and Safety
OL,9,FExecutive (HSENI) has been informed.
OL,11,FPolice and the ambulance service are
OL,12,Fcurrently at the scene of the incident
OL,13,Fin the Coolyvenny Road in Coleraine.
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,16,F(NIAS) received a 999 call at 08:45 GMT
OL,17,Fon Wednesday.
OL,19,FIt dispatched two Emergency Ambulances
OL,20,Fand two Ambulance Officers to the
OL,21,Fscene. No one was taken from the scene.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
